sine, a HER2-targeted antibody-drug conjugate, in patients with HER2-positive metastatic breast cancer. <i>Journal of clinical pharmacology 52(5):691–703</i>. DOI:<a href=\"https://doi.org/10.1177/0091270011403742\">10.1177/0091270011403742</a> PUBMED:<a href=\"https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/21953571\">21953571</a></p></li></ol></body></html>", revisions = "<html><body><ul><li>11/2026 generated by pharmacolibrary-dev export.pharmacolibrary_models from Gupta_2012: parameters extracted from the paper by the pharmacolibrary-dev pipeline, model built by its engineer, reviewed: curated candidate</li></ul></body></html>"),
